WEBVTT

00:01:00.555 --> 00:01:02.408
(Risate)

00:01:02.432 --> 00:01:07.471
(Beatbox)

00:01:15.912 --> 00:01:17.825
NP: Papi, papi, papi, papi, papi, papi,

00:01:17.849 --> 00:01:19.842
fermo, fermo, fermo, fermo!

00:01:19.866 --> 00:01:22.127
Oddio!

00:01:22.151 --> 00:01:23.692
Ok, mi sta sfidando!

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.858
Fermi, fermi.

00:01:25.882 --> 00:01:29.871
Ti ricordi quando facevi
il beatbox per farmi dormire?

00:01:29.895 --> 00:01:31.324
EC: Sì, sì, mi ricordo.